{
  "bookId": "activity-extra-chunjie",
  "id": "source-17303",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "17303001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田彩音",
          "text": "嘿嘿~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17303002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "彩音今天，好像很高兴的样子。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17303003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田彩音",
          "text": "当然了，今天可是新年第一天哦，而且~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17303004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "而且？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17303005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田彩音",
          "text": "我给主人准备了巨大的惊喜！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17303006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "那优纪有吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17303007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田彩音",
          "text": "……哈哈我看到主人来了！我先去找主人了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17303008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17303009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这是彩音给我准备的礼物？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17303010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田彩音",
          "text": "是的~主人有没有超感动的！？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17303011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "为了准备这些，彩音花了不少心思吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17303012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田彩音",
          "text": "嘿嘿，这么厉害的主人，当然只有厉害的礼物才能配的上了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17303013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "那我就好好收下了，那么作为回礼，彩音有什么想要的吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17303014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田彩音",
          "text": "唔……那就，陪我玩游戏吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17303015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "咦，只是这样吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17303016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田彩音",
          "text": "对于彩音来说，这就是最棒的礼物啦！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17303017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田彩音",
          "text": "主人，来，决一胜负吧，今天也要大战到天明。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17303018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "可是现在也才是白天吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17303019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田彩音",
          "text": "不要在意这些细节，优纪也加入吧！嗯，这就当给你的礼物补偿了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17303020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "那么事先说好了，就算是礼物，我可是不会输的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17303021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田彩音",
          "text": "哦哦，发出这样宣言的主人，果然也超帅气呀。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17303022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "彩音的夸奖也很可爱呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "17303023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田彩音",
          "text": "欸嘿嘿~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
